      "html": "<div> <p>You shoot a greenish ray at a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 2d8 Poison damage and has the <a>Poisoned</a> condition until the end of your next turn.</p> <p><strong><em>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</em></strong> The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 1.</p> </div>",
